  {
    "ts": "2026-07-29T20:07:22+00:00",
    "headline": "Lam Research (LRCX) Is Down 16.3% After China Lithography Jitters Hit Chip-Equipment Sentiment",
    "summary": "In recent days, Lam Research has been caught in a broad semiconductor pullback as investors weigh upcoming earnings, tighter Federal Reserve expectations, and escalating Middle East tensions alongside sector-specific worries about new Chinese lithography capabilities. This mix of macro uncertainty and potential shifts in China-related chip equipment demand has put extra focus on how Lam’s business is exposed across regions and end markets. Next, we'll examine how concerns about China’s...",
